      "body": "## Motivation\n\nKeep the GLM-5.2 MI355X MXFP4 five-step MTP cookbook commands in sync with the InferenceX AgentX recipe and its latest validated SGLang ROCm daily image, [SemiAnalysisAI/InferenceX#3851](https://github.com/SemiAnalysisAI/InferenceX/pull/3851). The command builder still pinned `…-20260923` and the page text `…-20260930`, and the two MTP cells did not carry the recipe's prefill chunk size, static memory fraction or HiCache host pool size.\n\n## Modifications\n\n- `dockerImages[\"mi355x|mxfp4\"]`: `lmsysorg/sglang-rocm:v0.5.20-rocm720-mi35x-20260923` → `lmsysorg/sglang-rocm:v0.5.21-rocm720-mi35x-20261008`. As in #41109, this pin is shared by every MI355X MXFP4 cell.\n- MI355X MXFP4 **Low-Latency** (TP8/EP1): `--chunked-prefill-size 131072` → `32768`, `--mem-fraction-static 0.80` → `0.85`.\n- MI355X MXFP4 **High-Throughput** (TP4/EP4 HiCache): add `--chunked-prefill-size 32768`, and replace `--hicache-ratio 1.0` with `--hicache-size 180` (a 180 GB host KV pool per rank). `write_through` stays the default write policy.\n- `GLM-5.2.mdx`: update the AMD MTP note to the new image and these settings. Add a short source-reference comment in the config.\n- The Balanced and `mtp-314` cells, other precisions and other hardware are otherwise unchanged.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\nDocumentation only; no code changes. This image and flag set were validated by [InferenceX run 38067578883](https://github.com/SemiAnalysisAI/InferenceX/actions/runs/38067578883): all nine points (TP8/EP1 conc 1/2/4 and TP4/EP4 HiCache conc 4–16) passed, and GSM8K at TP4/EP4 conc 16 scored 0.9689 strict / 0.9719 flexible.\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\n\nNo new measurements. The values come from the InferenceX recipe and the run above.\n\n## Validation\n\n- Loaded `glm-5.2.jsx` with Node.js and compared it with `upstream/main`. Both versions have 52 cells. Only the two MI355X MXFP4 MTP cells change (the flags listed above), plus `dockerImages[\"mi355x|mxfp4\"]`; every other field is identical.\n- Preserved the file's existing line endings (it mixes CRLF and LF). `git -c core.whitespace=cr-at-eol diff --check` passes.\n- Did not run the full Mintlify build (sparse docs checkout). No components, navigation or links change.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Update documentation according to [Write documentations](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#write-documentations).\n\n## AI model disclosure\n\nPrepared with Claude Opus 5.5 via the Cursor agent at the author's request. No delegated models.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:white_check_mark: [Run #38161822686](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38161822686)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #38161822244](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38161822244)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:heavy_minus_sign: **No AMD PR run found for this commit**.<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
