    {
      "additions": 1,
      "blob_url": "https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/blob/4203ea007679b5b8236be1a1e79af08fdf1a616f/docs%2Fcookbook%2Fautoregressive%2FGLM%2FGLM-5.2.mdx",
      "changes": 2,
      "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/sgl-project/sglang/contents/docs%2Fcookbook%2Fautoregressive%2FGLM%2FGLM-5.2.mdx?ref=4203ea007679b5b8236be1a1e79af08fdf1a616f",
      "deletions": 1,
      "filename": "docs/cookbook/autoregressive/GLM/GLM-5.2.mdx",
      "patch": "@@ -137,7 +137,7 @@ import { agentx } from \"/src/snippets/agentx/zai-org/glm-5.2.jsx\";\n **gfx950 block-FP8 accuracy: fixed as of the pinned MI355X image (`v0.5.13.post1-rocm720-mi35x-20260618`).** Earlier SGLang ROCm images miscompiled AMD aiter's `gemm_a8w8_blockscale_bpreshuffle` GEMM on gfx950 (ROCm 7.2): the error was small per layer but compounded across all 78 layers and silently corrupted output — in-context reasoning broke (GSM8K ≈ 0) while short factual prompts still looked fine. The root cause was a gfx950/ROCm-7.2 miscompile of the CK kernel (a packed illegal-type FMA that relied on an LLVM coercion pass removed in ROCm 7.2; non-deterministic wrong rows near tile boundaries). This is resolved in the pinned image and newer: GLM-5.2-FP8 on MI350X/MI355X (gfx950) was re-validated at TP4 and TP8 — **GSM8K ≈ 0.96 (0% invalid)** and **15/15 needle-in-haystack retrieval to ~118K tokens**. **MI300X / MI325X (gfx942) were never affected.** If you must run an older image, treat gfx950 FP8 output as unverified. Background: [sgl-project/sglang#28685](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/issues/28685) (analysis) and the upstream CK fix [ROCm/rocm-libraries#8639](https://github.com/ROCm/rocm-libraries/pull/8639) (scalar FMA + accumulator anchor; restores correctness and determinism at -O3).\n </Note>\n \n-- **MTP / EAGLE speculative decoding on AMD.** Five-step MTP is validated for `amd/GLM-5.2-MXFP4` on MI355X with `lmsysorg/sglang-rocm:v0.5.20-rocm720-mi35x-20260930`. Choose **Low-Latency** for TP8/EP1, or **High-Throughput** for TP4/EP4 with HiCache (`--enable-hierarchical-cache --hicache-ratio 1.0`). HiCache uses the default `kernel`, `page_first`, and `write_through` settings. MTP remains unvalidated for GLM-5.2 on MI300X/MI325X and for the other MI355X checkpoint precisions.\n+- **MTP / EAGLE speculative decoding on AMD.** Five-step MTP is validated for `amd/GLM-5.2-MXFP4` on MI355X with `lmsysorg/sglang-rocm:v0.5.21-rocm720-mi35x-20261008`. Choose **Low-Latency** for TP8/EP1, or **High-Throughput** for TP4/EP4 with HiCache (`--enable-hierarchical-cache --hicache-size 180`, a 180 GB host KV pool per rank). Both use `--chunked-prefill-size 32768` and `--mem-fraction-static 0.85`. HiCache uses the default `kernel`, `page_first`, and `write_through` settings. MTP remains unvalidated for GLM-5.2 on MI300X/MI325X and for the other MI355X checkpoint precisions.\n \n ## 3. Advanced Usage\n ",
      "raw_url": "https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/raw/4203ea007679b5b8236be1a1e79af08fdf1a616f/docs%2Fcookbook%2Fautoregressive%2FGLM%2FGLM-5.2.mdx",
      "sha": "06dfcda6ad3423e31490efdb747ce805e7f19ab8",
      "status": "modified"
    },
    {
      "additions": 9,
      "blob_url": "https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/blob/4203ea007679b5b8236be1a1e79af08fdf1a616f/docs%2Fsrc%2Fsnippets%2Fconfigs%2Fzai-org%2Fglm-5.2.jsx",
      "changes": 15,
      "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/sgl-project/sglang/contents/docs%2Fsrc%2Fsnippets%2Fconfigs%2Fzai-org%2Fglm-5.2.jsx?ref=4203ea007679b5b8236be1a1e79af08fdf1a616f",
      "deletions": 6,
      "filename": "docs/src/snippets/configs/zai-org/glm-5.2.jsx",
      "patch": "@@ -97,7 +97,7 @@ sgl-eval run aime25 \\\\\n     gb300: \"lmsysorg/sglang:latest\",\r\n     b300:  \"lmsysorg/sglang:latest\",\r\n     mi355x: \"lmsysorg/sglang-rocm:v0.5.13.post1-rocm720-mi35x-20260618\",\r\n-    \"mi355x|mxfp4\": \"lmsysorg/sglang-rocm:v0.5.20-rocm720-mi35x-20260923\",\n+    \"mi355x|mxfp4\": \"lmsysorg/sglang-rocm:v0.5.21-rocm720-mi35x-20261008\",\n     mi325x: \"lmsysorg/sglang-rocm:v0.5.13.post1-rocm700-mi30x-20260616\",\r\n     mi300x: \"lmsysorg/sglang-rocm:v0.5.13.post1-rocm700-mi30x-20260616\",\r\n   },\r\n@@ -997,11 +997,13 @@ sgl-eval run aime25 \\\\\n     // weights fit a 4-GPU slice, mirroring the amd/GLM-5.1-MXFP4 MI355X recipe (same DSA\r\n     // architecture family) — --trust-remote-code (Quark custom quant config)\r\n     // and --kv-cache-dtype fp8_e4m3 both come from that precedent. Pinned to a\r\n-    // newer image (v0.5.20, see dockerImages[\"mi355x|mxfp4\"]) than the FP8/BF16\n+    // newer image (v0.5.21, see dockerImages[\"mi355x|mxfp4\"]) than the FP8/BF16\n     // mi355x cells. Low-Latency uses validated TP8/EP1; High-Throughput uses\r\n     // validated TP4/EP4. Both use five-step MTP from InferenceX PR #2900.\r\n     // DSA backend: triton (SGLang's ROCm default). Five-step MTP cells select\n-    // the top-k v2 indexer kernel, matching InferenceX PR #3724.\n+    // the top-k v2 indexer kernel, matching InferenceX PR #3724. Their 32K\n+    // prefill chunks, 0.85 static memory fraction and 180 GB/rank TP4/EP4\n+    // HiCache host pool match InferenceX PR #3851.\n     // ====================================================================\r\n     {\r\n       match: { hw: \"mi355x\", variant: \"default\", quant: \"mxfp4\", strategy: \"low-latency\", nodes: \"single\" },\r\n@@ -1019,8 +1021,8 @@ sgl-eval run aime25 \\\\\n         \"--speculative-num-steps 5\",\r\n         \"--speculative-eagle-topk 1\",\r\n         \"--speculative-num-draft-tokens 6\",\r\n-        \"--chunked-prefill-size 131072\",\r\n-        \"--mem-fraction-static 0.80\",\r\n+        \"--chunked-prefill-size 32768\",\r\n+        \"--mem-fraction-static 0.85\",\r\n         \"--watchdog-timeout 1200\",\r\n         \"--host {{HOST_IP}}\",\r\n         \"--port {{PORT}}\",\r\n@@ -1062,8 +1064,9 @@ sgl-eval run aime25 \\\\\n         \"--speculative-num-steps 5\",\r\n         \"--speculative-eagle-topk 1\",\r\n         \"--speculative-num-draft-tokens 6\",\r\n+        \"--chunked-prefill-size 32768\",\n         \"--enable-hierarchical-cache\",\n-        \"--hicache-ratio 1.0\",\n+        \"--hicache-size 180\",\n         \"--mem-fraction-static 0.85\",\r\n         \"--cuda-graph-max-bs-decode 256\",\r\n         \"--max-running-requests 256\",\r",
      "raw_url": "https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/raw/4203ea007679b5b8236be1a1e79af08fdf1a616f/docs%2Fsrc%2Fsnippets%2Fconfigs%2Fzai-org%2Fglm-5.2.jsx",
